common-sha1-64.bin holds the first 8 bytes of the SHA-1 of every entry of
xato-net-10-million-passwords-100000.txt (trimmed, NFKC-normalised, case-folded),
sorted. No password is stored in clear text. Regenerate with
scripts/gen_breached_passwords.py.

Source list: SecLists, Passwords/Common-Credentials/xato-net-10-million-passwords-100000.txt
https://github.com/danielmiessler/SecLists (commit c205c36a445bff37f8e58a9ec829105cd4975c58)
Underlying data: "Ten Million Passwords" by Mark Burnett (xato.net), released to the public domain.

